# Prime Number checkNumber

# Light weight web app that checks if a given a number is a prime
and return true else it return false;

## Features
    It evalute and return any positve interger;
    rutun bolean (true/false) if a number is prime or not

## Stacks
HTML for structure
CSS for styling.
JavaScrupt for interactive using Loop and conditional

## How the app works.
Any number less than or equal to 1 return false.
It check is a number is divisble of 2 to the square root
of the number.
If the divisble is found it returns true otherwise it returs false;

## Installation and setup
git clone https://github.com/oteikwu1/Prime-Number-Checker;

cd Prime-Number-Checker